</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Guidability Test</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix D Guidability Test ‣ Off-Trajectory Reasoning: Can LLMs Collaborate on Reasoning Trajectory?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> reports the number of unique problems and guiding trajectories used per guiding model (sub-column) for each LLM (row). Table <a href="#A4.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix D Guidability Test ‣ Off-Trajectory Reasoning: Can LLMs Collaborate on Reasoning Trajectory?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> reports guidability (individual) results for different length of the guiding steers measured by <math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\%</annotation></semantics></math> of the trajectories. Similarly, Table <a href="#A4.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ Appendix D Guidability Test ‣ Off-Trajectory Reasoning: Can LLMs Collaborate on Reasoning Trajectory?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> reports breakdown of guidability on shared subset. Table <a href="#A4.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ Appendix D Guidability Test ‣ Off-Trajectory Reasoning: Can LLMs Collaborate on Reasoning Trajectory?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> groups guidability (individual) scores by the guiding models (column) for each LLM (row)</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A4.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A4.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"></th>
<th id="A4.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" colspan="3"><span id="A4.T9.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"># of Problems</span></th>
<th id="A4.T9.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" colspan="3"><span id="A4.T9.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"># of Trajectories</span></th></tr>
<tr id="A4.T9.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T9.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r"></th>
<th id="A4.T9.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A4.T9.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DeepSeek-R1</span></th>
